# What the image builds itself, or does not need at runtime.
#
# `apps/web` and `packages/ui` stay in the context because `npm ci` installs
# the workspaces the lockfile lists; the runtime stage copies only their
# manifests, never their sources, so neither ends up in the image.

.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
.agents
docs

# The image takes its environment at runtime, so the sample files a developer
# copies are not part of it.
.env*
